## 📌 Project Overview

**DataNova Analytics** is an interactive data analytics and machine learning project designed to transform raw datasets into meaningful insights, interactive visualizations, and data-driven predictions.

The project combines:

- 📊 Data Analysis
- 🧹 Data Cleaning & Validation
- 🔍 Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- 📈 Interactive Data Visualization
- 📋 KPI & Business Metrics Analysis
- 🤖 Machine Learning
- 🎯 Predictive Modeling
- 📦 Data Exploration & Export

